     "explanation": "R68.84 is a Chapter 18 symptom code for jaw pain, which a medical or dental provider evaluates; a therapist does not diagnose or treat the jaw. F45.42, F45.8 and F54 are Chapter 5 mental and behavioral codes that can describe the psychological side, if the therapist documents that diagnosis.",
